# The eval harness (docs/guide/how-evals.md).
title: Recorded runs are checked on every pull request, and model-judged runs gate every promotion per group
direction: down
case: Eval case: input, recorded run, rubric
tier1: Tier 1: deterministic checks in go test
tier2: Tier 2: k runs on the skill's lane model
judge: Judge from another family scores 1 to 5
results: Group results: pass^k and mean score
compare: Compare with main's results for the group
gate: evals-gate refuses a failing promotion
case -> tier1: every pull request
tier1 -> tier2: after merge
tier2 -> judge
judge -> results
results -> compare
compare -> gate: gating groups only
